{
  "model": "IndexTeam/IndexTTS-2.5",
  "voice": "温暖自然英式女老师｜IndexTTS2.5 慢速教学",
  "pause_seconds": 0.7,
  "chunks": [
    {
      "id": "s16-p01",
      "text": "Asking for advice is not so easy.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s16-p01.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s16-p01.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s16-p02",
      "text": "In a recent study, 74% of people said they were afraid to ask for advice.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s16-p02.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s16-p02.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s16-p03",
      "text": "The same also applies to case studies.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s16-p03.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s16-p03.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s16-p04",
      "text": "But people who ask for advice are more likely to succeed at a task.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s16-p04.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s16-p04.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s16-p05",
      "text": "So how do you ask for advice?",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s16-p05.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s16-p05.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s16-p06",
      "text": "Look for the best person to give you advice.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s16-p06.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s16-p06.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s16-p07",
      "text": "It's just like choosing the right belt for an outfit.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s16-p07.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s16-p07.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s16-p08",
      "text": "It might be easy to ask all your dear friends on social media for advice at once.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s16-p08.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s16-p08.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s16-p09",
      "text": "But will you value all the advice equally?",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s16-p09.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s16-p09.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s16-p10",
      "text": "Probably not.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s16-p10.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s16-p10.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s16-p11",
      "text": "It might be better to choose one or two people whose opinions you value most.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s16-p11.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s16-p11.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s16-p12",
      "text": "Ideally, you can have a dialogue with people who have experience in the topic you're asking about.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s16-p12.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s16-p12.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s16-p13",
      "text": "For example, in playing chess, provide enough information clearly.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s16-p13.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s16-p13.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s16-p14",
      "text": "For example, imagine you can't decide how to organise a club activity.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s16-p14.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s16-p14.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s16-p15",
      "text": "You should provide the topic, the place and the time.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s16-p15.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s16-p15.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s16-p16",
      "text": "You should also consider when to ask.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s16-p16.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s16-p16.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s16-p17",
      "text": "If your questions require a lot of thought, ask the person when he or she is clear-headed.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s16-p17.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s16-p17.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s16-p18",
      "text": "Remember to double your efforts in checking the information and not to hurry your decisions.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s16-p18.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s16-p18.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s16-p19",
      "text": "Be specific when you ask questions.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s16-p19.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s16-p19.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s16-p20",
      "text": "Imagine you want to start a business and you find a business owner.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s16-p20.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s16-p20.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s16-p21",
      "text": "Instead of asking, 'What advice do you have for me?'",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s16-p21.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s16-p21.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s16-p22",
      "text": "Try asking, 'What college classes did you find helpful for starting a business?'",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s16-p22.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s16-p22.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s16-p23",
      "text": "Anyway, don't let the fear of being judged stop you from seeking advice.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s16-p23.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s16-p23.mp3"
    }
  ],
  "word_audio": "browser speech synthesis en-GB"
}
